<title>HONG KONG: Four Seas Travel H1 profit up 19.02 pct.</title>
<headline>Four Seas Travel H1 profit up 19.02 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended September 30</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   4.91   vs 4.12</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    1.3    vs 1.3</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  nil    vs nil</p>
<p>    Net			    8.83   vs 7.42</p>
<p>    Turnover		     802.85 vs 760.40</p>
<p>    Company name		 Four Seas Travel International Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  January 13-17</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   January 24</p>
<p>NOTE - Four Seas Travel engages in the sale of airline tickets and the provision of other related travel services and property investment.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
